  <diagram id="reuse-plan-flowthrough-f06-structural-fairness" name="Design FlowThrough and symmetric structural fairness" ecgTitle="Design FlowThrough and symmetric structural fairness" ecgDescription="The design flag belongs to ReusePlan record requests. The symmetric --flowthrough all control gives LRU, GRASP, P-OPT, and ReusePlan the same no-allocate opportunity on the structural stream each workload actually consumes, with source-specific receipts in all three simulators.">
